  "kernel": "d3de96b8ca122f52a8446dd5b3a51146d9eaa777",
  "kernel_repo": "Aiden-HQ/AidenHQ",
  "notes": [
    "May add authority (grants, writes, roles or secrets) in: primer. Auto-updates accept it; turn them off to review first.",
    "The updater installs graduated releases only, with a host-only candidate exception",
    "Local until GitHub is connected, then GitHub for new repositories",
    "New installs carry meetings, Slack, Jira, Glean, Primer, security and design, quiet until connected",
    "Setup asks whether to connect your organization's Primer or run your own",
    "The board's typed settings changes are written again, by the instance's code host",
    "Engineering works on a local-only install; one routing rule picks the code host from the repo",
    "One owner per install moves the product pin",
    "An Engineer job may merge a product PR whose head its own task pushed",
    "A delegated task left blocked reaches whoever delegated it",
    "Connection health comes from the kernel, not the board's own probes",
    "A second reviewer's approve never clears a first unsure",
    "Self-hosted Primer connects from the board by pasting its token",
    "The launcher waits for its config instead of crash-looping on install",
    "Any Engineer job opens a PR in its own branch namespace; platform authority stays narrow"
  ],
  "release": "2026.11.19.2"
}
